Apple today <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/10/developers-bring-incredible-new-app-experiences-to-iphone-duo/">highlighted more than 50 third-party App Store apps</a> that are or will soon be fully optimized for the iPhone Duo and its various layouts and poses.<br/>
<br/>
